<block><txt break.before="1">An Act relating to the wearing of membership
badges issued by certain associations of discharged servicemen; and for
purposes connected therewith.</txt></block></tier>
</content>


<content type="body">

<level type="clause" id="sec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_deca8905-b0c3-48dc-90be-7f63ace24e5f"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>1</no><heading guid="_5839fb45-fa90-4ec4-8914-7e329fd1edb3"
id="sec.1-he"><b>Name of Act</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act may be cited as the <legref
refid="act-1964-049" jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Discharged Servicemen&#8217;s Badges Act
1964</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_a6dfb31e-288a-4bdf-84b5-2478dc1b77c2"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>2</no><heading guid="_261fecf3-0091-48ca-8c7f-2fa68c6d5135"
id="sec.2-he"><b>Interpretation</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.2-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_081930ae-281f-4047-8515-4ea74a7729ac"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.2-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this Act, <defterm type="definition"
guid="_53e571e4-7101-4e9d-9653-e22bd3b77cb1"
id="sec.2-def.Dischargedservicemensassociation"><b><i>Discharged
servicemen&#8217;s association</i></b></defterm> means the body specified in
the Schedule and any body whose name is, for the time being, added to that
Schedule pursuant to subsection (2).</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.2-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_684965b9-3358-4661-8e5b-b6abe140a33d"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.2-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Where a request in writing is made to the
Governor by any body that the name of that body be added to the Schedule and
the Governor is satisfied that that body is principally comprised of a
substantial number of persons who have been discharged from enlistment or
appointment for service with any of Her Majesty&#8217;s Naval, Military or Air
Forces or with the forces of the United Nations, the Governor may, by order
published on the NSW legislation website, add the name of that body to the
Schedule.</txt></block></tier>


<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 2:</b> Am 2009 No 56,
Sch 4.13.</txt></content>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_fe6f7c78-6268-47a2-940b-d51aaed8f760"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>3</no><heading guid="_d9ff46b4-8122-4702-aa81-0c4f2197ac7e"
id="sec.3-he"><b>Unauthorised wearing of badges</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.3-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_203e4264-d627-435d-9655-abdd1183c283"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A person shall not, without lawful excuse,
wear:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_35cec0ec-0c6a-4ad7-8e5b-472ae77cea2f" id="sec.3-ssec.1-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">a badge of a kind issued by a discharged
servicemen&#8217;s association for the purpose of indicating that a person is
a member of that association, unless he is a member of that association,
or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_a1eed3d3-fb05-4b5f-bf87-b49ed319d8cb" id="sec.3-ssec.1-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">a badge, not being a badge referred to in
paragraph (a), similar to such a badge or so nearly similar thereto as to be
likely to deceive.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.3-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_22500032-c7fa-457a-8356-68290d86cfb8"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Where a person who has been, but by reason only
of his failure to pay to a discharged servicemen&#8217;s association any
moneys payable under the rules of that association, has ceased to be, a member
of that association, would be guilty of an offence arising under paragraph (a)
of subsection (1), he shall not be guilty of that offence by reason of his
wearing a badge of a kind issued by that association unless:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_789bbc52-4d55-4e26-9011-f687b3e83e95" id="sec.3-ssec.2-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">he has been served, in the manner provided by
those rules, with notice of his failure to pay those moneys,
and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_2b9010c6-aa7d-4b55-bfd7-7a76b9d2329b" id="sec.3-ssec.2-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">he has failed to pay those moneys within the time
specified in the notice or, where no time is so specified, within one month
after the notice has been so served.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_9e0c52ab-2236-471a-8d05-ad9649e6f6af"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>4</no><heading guid="_9f95ab0e-6435-4dc5-b764-67e027c0dd2f"
id="sec.4-he"><b>Penalty and proceedings for offences</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_f9d92b36-d26e-426a-9467-4d138027d046"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A person guilty of an offence against this Act is
liable to a penalty not exceeding 2 penalty units.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_e0292da2-32ef-4b3b-a21d-fc18f08347f9"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">All proceedings for offences against this Act
shall be disposed of summarily before the Local Court.</txt></block></tier>


<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 4:</b> Am 1993 No 46,
Sch 1; 1999 No 31, Sch 4.26; 2007 No 94, Sch 2.</txt></content>
</level>
</content>


